## Deviations from Coq

* The quantifiers over hypermaps are over a dart type `D : Type u` with `[Fintype D]`, so the
  properties are universe-polymorphic; `~~ exact_fitp x p` is `G.exactFitp x p = false`, and
  `(arity x == n) = false` is `G.arity x ≠ n`.
* The leaves are checked with the kernel-fast checks of `FourColor.Fast` (proved equal to the
  faithful ones) and with a pruned quiz tree `qztPruneFast theQuizTree m`, whose mask `m`
  (a certificate, computed natively by `FourColor.PruneGen`) is stored in the tree; the
  soundness of `redpart` holds for any pruned tree (`Hypermap.no_fit_redpart_prune`).
* A Hubcap leaf is checked with any drule fork `rf : DruleFork n` given to `checkTree` (all are
  equal to `theDruleForkTemplate n`), in practice the literal forks `QuizData.theDruleForkN`.
